\item[S2] Wood, David R., Number of Cliques in Minor-Closed Classes, Open Problem Garden, node 37081. Complete problem, discussion and bibliography (including mathematical image alt text). \url{https://www.openproblemgarden.org/op/number_of_cliques_in_minor_closed_classes}.
